@startuml
title Timing <latex>t_1</latex>
robust "<latex>x_1</latex> in" as A
concise "Out <math>y^2</math>" as B
robust "Data" as C
A has "<latex>\frac{a}{b}</latex>" as hi, "Lo" as lo
C has Idle, Busy

@0
A is hi
B is "<latex>s_0</latex>"
C is Idle : <latex>n_0</latex> start

@50
A is lo
B is "<math>s^2</math>"
C is Busy
A@50 -> B@+10 : <latex>m_1</latex> sent
A@0 <-> @50 : {<latex>\Delta t_1</latex>}
@0 <-> @50 : {<math>t_2</math>}
highlight 0 to 50 #Gold : <latex>\alpha</latex> span
note top of A : above <latex>e^x</latex>
note bottom of B : below <math>a_1</math>
@enduml
